Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4951060,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"currency":null,"divisor":100,"initial":null,"discount_percent":null,"is_free":false,"formatted_final_price":null,"is_free_field_present":false,"is_coming_soon":true,"is_coming_soon_field_present":true},"error_code":"price_not_announced"},{"game_id":"steam-4951060","metric":"review_count","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:45:16Z","status":"ok","value":0,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4951060,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":null},{"game_id":"steam-4951060","metric":"review_positive_percent","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:45:16Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4951060,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4951060-1847286114041089","game_id":"steam-4951060","kind":"announcement","title":"The Trophy Case (v0.61)","summary":"Version 0.61.9 BETA — and everything since 0.59.0. This is the last big update before Graveyard Shift opens in Early Access on October 27, and it is a big one. Fifteen versions have been filed since the last post, with 21 new things and 149 fixes. The biggest change is to Mystery cards. Every copy now rolls the first time you reveal it, from a bit weaker to a bit stronger, and keeps that roll all run. One roll in 20 is PERFECT and wears its own star-studded frame. The Book of Tutorials grew from","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T02:49:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114041089","verified_at":"2026-10-25T05:31:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4951060-1846018067938861","game_id":"steam-4951060","kind":"announcement","title":"What the Dead Carried (v0.59)","summary":"Version 0.59.0 BETA — and everything since 0.58.2. Three shifts have been filed since the last post — eight new things and 69 fixes. The biggest is the lore book. It is rebuilt as a short book, What the Dead Carried, nine chapters long, and 34 of its paragraphs are missing when you start. They come back as you play, each at the moment it happens — your first night, a boss's first fall, a Friend joining you, the ghost monkeys' chain, a note found in a pocket. Every note you had already found is s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T16:41:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067938861","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:12:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4951060-1846018067929674","game_id":"steam-4951060","kind":"announcement","title":"Fire Flares (v0.58)","summary":"Version 0.58.2 BETA — and everything since 0.54.0. Thirteen shifts have been filed since the last post — sixteen new things and more than a hundred fixes. The biggest is fire. Burn was the weakest of the three rots, and now it is the one to fear. Every turn a Burn burns it can crit — a FLARE — and the chance climbs from 25% on its first turn to every turn by its fourth. Poison or Bleed on the same creature make the crit bigger, a second Burn keeps the fire going longer, and the fire cards burn t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T13:26:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067929674","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:12:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4951060-1845383656386530","game_id":"steam-4951060","kind":"announcement","title":"Card Tags (v0.54)","summary":"Version 0.54.0 BETA — and everything since 0.47.0. Eight shifts have been filed since the last post — thirty-one new things and more than a hundred and fifty fixes. Most of them change how the night looks and sounds. One hundred and seventy new sounds arrived in one go, so every creature has its own attack and its own death and every boss its own farewell. A hundred creatures were redrawn in cleaner, sharper art, at the same size and in the same place. Every school's cards wear a carved frame of","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T14:34:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656386530","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:12:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4951060-1844751498217203","game_id":"steam-4951060","kind":"announcement","title":"The Night Visitors (v0.47)","summary":"Version 0.47.0 BETA — and everything since 0.44.1. Six shifts have been filed since the last post: twenty new things and fifty-two fixes. The biggest of them is the thing that used to happen between nights. The old event screen was a plain plate with a few oddly worded choices and rewards nobody remembered. It is gone. Once a week now, at random, somebody knocks. Twenty visitors, each painted into their own scene of the morgue, and every one of them puts three doors in front of you. No two choic","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T02:54:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498217203","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:12:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4951060-1843481262692202","game_id":"steam-4951060","kind":"announcement","title":"The Wax Seal (v0.44)","summary":"Version 0.44.1 BETA — and everything since 0.41.0. Ten shifts have been filed since the last post: twenty-four new things and a hundred and forty-one fixes. Most of that is the game finally looking like one place instead of a drawn approximation of one. Every scene stands on a painted backdrop now — the morgue, the intake and tally screens, the weekend, the Masters' Tree, both week-four yards and all eight beats of the crossing. The game still paints its own moon, its people and its whole interf","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-10T13:22:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262692202","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:12:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4951060-1842846814442052","game_id":"steam-4951060","kind":"announcement","title":"The Weekly Shift (v0.41)","summary":"Version 0.41.0 BETA — and everything since 0.38.1.Eleven days, twenty-three builds, 62 new things and 188 fixes, most of them from the notes you sent through the ! BUG button. The big one is a new way to play the month: every Monday the yard posts one contract for everyone, and a board to go with it. Under it, the intake got smaller and sharper, the leaderboard learned to show what a run was actually made of, the Ledger's debts stopped biting for a lifetime, and a long list of things that used t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-03T03:00:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814442052","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:12:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4951060-1841579228673699","game_id":"steam-4951060","kind":"announcement","title":"Graveyard Shift enters Early Access November 2","summary":"The gate opens November 2. Aldric was a Battle Sage once. Now he runs the night shift at the morgue, and the dead do not stay on the table. Every body that comes through the door is a card for his deck — a blade, a poison, a ward, a memory — and every night something walks in from the graveyard to take it back. Graveyard Shift: A Sage's Last Stand launches into Early Access on November 2, 2026, at 15% off for launch week. The free demo is on Steam right now, and it is the real first week — not a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-23T16:38:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228673699","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:12:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4951060-1841579228672089","game_id":"steam-4951060","kind":"announcement","title":"The Dead Push Back (v0.38)","summary":"Version 0.38.1 BETA — and everything since 0.36.0 Two things changed since the last post, and they pull against each other on purpose. The run got a shape: five nights a week, Monday to Friday, a boss on Friday, and a weekend the week's score pays for. And the dead got smarter about it. They resist what you throw. They bring a healer. They stand in a line and make you choose who dies first. A month is fifteen nights before the moon now — a third shorter than it was — and every one of them knows ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-22T19:21:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228672089","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:12:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4951060-1840310314353079","game_id":"steam-4951060","kind":"announcement","title":"What the Night Hands You (v0.36)","summary":"What the Night Hands You Version 0.36.0 BETA — and everything since 0.34.6 A deckbuilder is only as good as the moment it offers you a card. That moment was broken here for a long time, and this update is mostly about fixing it. A Rare used to turn up in HALF of all offers. It was 1.42× rarer than a Common — the entire ladder, Common to Legendary, spanned barely three times. Rarity was a word on a card, not a thing that happened to you. It is a real ladder now, the card faces finally say which r","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-11T04:05:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314353079","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:12:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4951060-1839676055883906","game_id":"steam-4951060","kind":"announcement","title":"The House Rules (v0.34)","summary":"The house always wins. Now you can see it happen. Graveyard Shift's gambling cards have always rolled real dice under the hood — you just had no way to watch them. This update hands you the numbers. NEW ROLL CARDS THROW A DIE YOU CAN READ — Grave Gambit, Chaos Blade, Chain Reaction and Death's Jackpot each land an obsidian twenty-sider showing the number they actually rolled, with the card's range printed beneath it. A wide gamble finally tells you how it went. NO FACE LIES — the die is numbered","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-30T01:02:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055883906","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:12:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4951060-1839676055881563","game_id":"steam-4951060","kind":"announcement","title":"The Demo Is Live — Take the Night Shift","summary":"The morgue doors are open.The Graveyard Shift demo is live. Aldric has one week of night shifts to survive, and everything he has is a deck of cards and whatever the dark leaves on his table. WHAT'S IN THE DEMOTHE FULL LOOP — fight the night, take your reward, spend at the shop, upgrade at the workshop, and go again. Nothing is cut down; this is the real game, one week of it. THE INTAKE RITE — every body that comes through the morgue has a story on the clipboard, and what you do with it matters.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-29T04:48:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055881563","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:12:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4951060-1839041357036336","game_id":"steam-4951060","kind":"announcement","title":"The Long Shift (v0.32)","summary":"Every family gets an engine. Twelve new cards, one signature engine for each family, so a run finally has something to build toward instead of just a pile of good cards. NEW WISDOM HOLDS ITS HAND — Study, The Long Shift, Memorized Procedure and Total Recall all pay you for cards kept ON HOLD between turns. Held cards grow stronger the longer you keep them, and they remember what they grew. CHAOS PLAYS THE JACKPOT — Loaded Dice, House Money, Streak and The House Always Wins turn every roll you ma","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-27T17:14:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357036336","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:12:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4951060-1839041357036334","game_id":"steam-4951060","kind":"announcement","title":"The Festering (v0.31)","summary":"Rot is a build now. Poison, Bleed and Burn stopped being chip damage and became something you construct a run around — and the creatures that shrug off blades finally have an answer. NEW VIRULENCE — a new Plague rare. For one essence, every Poison, Bleed and Burn already on the creature SWELLS by 25% / 50% / 75% up its ranks. The first true payoff card for affliction builds. ANCIENTS ARE A PUZZLE, NOT A WALL — old bones still blunt your cards, taking half damage from direct hits, but Poison, Ble","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-27T17:13:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357036334","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:12:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4951060-1839041357036333","game_id":"steam-4951060","kind":"announcement","title":"The Collector (v0.30)","summary":"The shift gets a permanent record. Achievements are live, the combo ledger grows, mastering your cards finally pays, and the shop becomes something you actually look forward to. NEW STEAM ACHIEVEMENTS — 30 of them, each with its own hand-made icon: boss kills, night milestones, combo feats and the quiet horrors nobody should manage on their first run. TWELVE NEW COMBOS — the ledger grows to 67. Reclaim all four cards the Coroner stole (THE COLLECTOR), fell a week boss without dropping below half","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-27T17:12:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357036333","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:12:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4951060-1839041357036331","game_id":"steam-4951060","kind":"announcement","title":"The Road to the Demo — 59 Versions of Night Shifts","summary":"A long run of night shifts. Graveyard Shift started as a browser prototype and became a native Steam game. Before the demo opens the morgue doors, here is the road that got us here — pulled from fifty-nine versions of patch notes.